@startuml SE_27_RemovePatientFromQueue
title Sequence Diagram: SE_27 Xóa bệnh nhân khỏi hàng đợi
actor "Bác sĩ / Lễ tân" as Staff
participant "View\n(QueueActivity)" as View
participant "CheckInController" as Controller
participant "CheckInQueueService" as Service
participant "CheckInQueueRepository" as Repo
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Staff -> View: Hủy lịch xếp hàng (Vắng mặt)
activate View
View -> Controller: removePatientFromQueue(queueId)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: markAsSkippedOrCancelled(queueId)
activate Service
Service -> DB: UPDATE check_in_queue SET status='CANCELLED'
Service --> Controller: success
Controller --> View: 200 OK
View --> Staff: Xóa thành công, gọi người kế
deactivate View
@enduml